Package: Neoantimon2
Type: Package
Title: Neoantigen Reconstruction and Scoped Evidence Analysis
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Takanori", "Hasegawa", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "takanorihasegawa@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Reconstructs genomic events, coding sequence origins, altered
    peptides and peptide-HLA candidates against explicitly selected references.
    Retains provider provenance, uncertainty and evaluability across somatic,
    longitudinal, presentation and receptor evidence. Supports declarative
    vaccine-set selection and literature-derived indirect-HLA analysis with
    independent native allo-HLA evidence overlays. Research outputs do not
    provide clinical interpretation or a universal immunogenicity score.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite, digest, stringi, yaml, xml2, tools
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), jsonvalidate, pkgload
Config/testthat/edition: 3
